{{also|Rämä|rämä|rama|Rama|ráma|râma|rāma|Rāma|râmă|ramă|råmą|ɽama}}
==English==

===Etymology===
A [[w:en:libfix|libfix]], a modification of {{m|en|-orama}}, influenced by {{m|en|diorama}} and {{m|en|panorama}}, and thus indirectly derived from {{der|en|grc|ὅρᾱμᾰ|t=sight, spectacle}}.

===Suffix===
{{head|en|suffixes}}

# {{n-g|Alteration of}} '''[[-orama]]''', {{n-g|used in suffixing a word ending with an ''r'' or vowel sound.}}
#: ''camera'' → ''[[camerarama|camera'''rama''']]'' or
#: ''future'' → ''[[futurama|futu'''rama''']]'' (formed by eliding the ''e'' and merging the two ''r''s into one)

====Usage notes====
* The suffix is usually appended without hyphenation, or occasionally with hyphen intended to catch the eye.

